(text "Initial contract: mode0, <=10MHz, 45-55% SCK duty; -40..85C.\nSame +3V3_MCU rail for host, NAND and both buffer supplies.\nRead timing requires CL<=10pF at U40Y and <=5ns path/edge allowance.\nFirmware: CS high before output enable, CLK low, wait startup/busy; ECC8 + bad blocks + FTL.\nNo high-rate uncompressed playback or power-loss durability acceptance yet." (at 25.4 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "946d1293-8971-41cd-a284-774ee40d40c3"))
